VERSION "Hayabusa Gen3 (5JCZSJ) - v0.1 scaffold. Switch cluster 0x1D1 + cruise decoded from the ECU firmware (FUN_7201A/FUN_72BB4) and two bus traces; telemetry frames are stubs to confirm with ground-truth captures (see can-capture-plan.md). Senders for broadcast frames are INFERRED - correct them as you label."

